<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-11-07T15:48:04.951Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 07 Nov 2026 15:48:04 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Philippine Coast Guard has contained an oil spill off Mariveles, Bataan, removing 800 kg of oil-contaminated debris, while the Philippine Navy is probing a reservist for an inciting social-media post in Manila. China has deployed more than 100 warships and coast guard vessels across the western Pacific and sent a survey vessel with unidentified equipment into Scarborough Shoal, raising maritime tension. The Department of Environment and Natural Resources ordered immediate assessment and containment of the Mariveles spill, coordinating with the Coast Guard and local governments. 176 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.scmp.com/news/china/diplomacy/article/3373651/manila-weighs-second-south-china-sea-legal-case-against-beijing-analyst&quot;&gt;South China Morning Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiaEFVX3lxTE5tRzhYeTU2Qzg2OVR5NjlMa3ViY2NkY1dKNGRDT29kNVctYU16cU5LNk9LNFc4QnpJUGZZVFcwRWdPRFNEWHczSkNCcmVVaml5aHk0a21Oc3ZVWXlydTJ0bTl2WXdpdDRV?oc=5&quot;&gt;astig.ph&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxQWDRhVkUzM0JLZktPNGotN3hvTTBTZ0Z3SEpPZEJZNlFJQm1rY2FuMTdpek5uZTVFSE5YWHl2X21vQ1NhTTZaWFlaM0JPV3RkSjRtcDZYY3NKeC1GSWs2Y0tnZ2JNUHJ2Nk81VDRZN1FQb2RaR215WXpwUTdRcldCRGU3dXZxSl9OZ19xVA?oc=5&quot;&gt;brigadanews.ph&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eurasia Review&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;National Security News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxNX2ZqUnk0UU5UNWJ3LURPTnkzZ1FMZVF1MHdBSDZqYzVtTmJVZXU0enZHcWRLcng1N3F1N1RHd2x5MmFoclZLbXVfdzN0Wll6dHo2WnFMaUpZZklFVFJCQUFMb1dIYkZJdzY3T19BMS0tWG8xLUc2UFdQbjY2S21MV3BnVQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Manila Bulletin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https:/